            <ArticleTitle>Dasatinib-induced chylothorax in chronic myeloid leukemia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>71-73</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pulmonary adverse events are common abnormalities associated with the use of dasatinib in chronic myeloid leukemia. We present a case of a 69-year-old man who suddenly developed a rare chylothorax pulmonary adverse event following 10 months of dasatinib treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
